+# BUG-003-r1 report
+
+## Summary
+
+`escape_field` now keeps a character only when it is printable and its code point is below 128, and every other character still becomes `\xNN`, `\uNNNN`, or `\UNNNNNNNN`, so a finding line is ASCII before it is written. In `collect`, a `types` or `traits` path that exists, is not a link, and is not a folder is recorded with `found.append((layer, "link"))` and is not walked, so it is printed as `FAIL (form) <root>/<layer>: <layer> - path is not a conditional-workflow file`, the same line a layer link already uses.
+
+## How the change addresses the named cause
+
+Defect 1: `escape_field` itself drops every non-ASCII character into the existing hex escape, so the bytes of a finding line no longer depend on the console encoding or on `errors="backslashreplace"`.
+
+Defect 2: the `os.path.isdir` test in `collect` no longer `continue`s past a layer path that is a file; it records that path the same way a layer link is recorded, and the walk never opens it.
+
+## Files changed
+
+- `bridge/cursor-bridge/workflow-check.py` — `escape_field` (and its docstring) and the non-folder branch in `collect`
+- `bridge/cursor-bridge/MANIFEST.json` — regenerated by `python tools/make-manifest.py` (generated timestamp `2026-10-17 04:13` and the `cursor-bridge/workflow-check.py` sha256)
+- `handoff/BUG-003-r1-report.md` — this report
+
+`bridge/cursor-bridge/VERSION` is not in the diff. `docs/BUILDER_NOTES.md` was not changed. Every file under `tests/` is unchanged.
+
+## Mutation check
+
+- M1 · `test_r014_output_is_ascii_on_every_console[utf-8]`, `test_r014_output_is_ascii_on_every_console[cp1252]`
+- M2 · `test_r014_layer_path_that_is_a_file_is_form`
+
+## Done
+
+### 1. Before any edit
+
+Command: `python -m pytest tests -q`
+
+Working folder: Workspace root.
+
+Exit code: 1.
+
+Relevant output: `3 failed, 1225 passed, 23 skipped in 252.75s (0:04:12)`. Failures: `tests/test_workflow_check.py::test_r014_output_is_ascii_on_every_console[utf-8]`, `tests/test_workflow_check.py::test_r014_output_is_ascii_on_every_console[cp1252]`, `tests/test_workflow_check.py::test_r014_layer_path_that_is_a_file_is_form`.
+
+### 2. After the fix
+
+Command: `python -m pytest tests/test_workflow_check.py tests/test_workflows_line_check.py tests/test_conformance_check.py -q`
+
+Working folder: Workspace root.
+
+Exit code: 0.
+
