+- [ ] `test_r014_layer_path_that_is_a_file_is_form` passes (it failed before the change).
+- [ ] `python -m pytest tests -q` exits 0. The counts are those of step 1 of Done with the three failures above turned to passes and nothing else changed. Every file under `tests/` is byte-for-byte unchanged.
