+- [ ] Both causes are addressed at their mechanism: the escaping decides ASCII itself rather than relying on the console's encoding or its error handler; the layer test reports the non-folder path rather than skipping it.
+
+## Constraints
+- Do not fix by suppressing the symptom — no retry, broad `try/except`, widened tolerance, added `sleep`, or null-check that hides a wrong value. Here that also means: do not change how standard output is configured, do not set an encoding on it, do not filter output after it is written.
