+- Mutation check (your own, in-process, by hand; no script of it lands in the diff): after the fix passes, apply each mutant below alone, run the named command from the Workspace root, record which cases failed, then restore the fixed code exactly. M1 — `escape_field` keeps every printable character again (the ASCII condition removed): `python -m pytest tests/test_workflow_check.py -q -k "ascii_on_every_console"`, expected to fail both cases. M2 — the non-folder layer path skipped again: `python -m pytest tests/test_workflow_check.py -q -k "layer_path_that_is_a_file"`, expected to fail. List both in the report as: mutant · cases that caught it. Run the mutants before step 3 of Done.
+- Do not add dependencies.
