+- In any Markdown you write, never break a line inside a paragraph or a list item; one paragraph is one line.
+- Any console process your code launches on Windows is created windowless (`creationflags=subprocess.CREATE_NO_WINDOW`, `0` on other platforms). This fix launches no process.
+- Never start a server, a watcher or a daemon; nothing you run may outlive its command.
